# Build output that is tracked on purpose (see AGENTS.md): `frontend/out/` is
# the Next.js static export and `server/dashboard/` its packaged copy that
# `scripts/release.py` ships in the wheel. Both are minified and regenerated
# wholesale by the next build, so indexing them adds ~30% noise to a Graphify
# graph — minified identifiers become the top "god nodes" and swamp the real
# architecture. Graphify reads .gitignore too; this entry survives
# `graphify extract --no-gitignore`, which only stops .gitignore being read.
frontend/out/
server/dashboard/
